# This directory contains CRDs synced from config/crd/bases/
#
# CRDs are generated from Go code in api/ using controller-gen and synced here.
# Source of truth: config/crd/bases/ (generated by 'make manifests')
#
# To sync CRDs to this directory:
#   make sync-crds
#
# CRDs are automatically synced when running 'make manifests'
#
# Do not edit CRDs in this directory directly - they will be overwritten on sync.
